            "review_text": "wendywandering\nVentura, California30 contributions\n0\nExcellent food and service\nFeb 2019 • Friends\nOur party of four had the pleasure of dinner at this wonderful restaurant. It was one of the best meals we’ve had in 10 days of travel through Vietnam. Two of us shared the set menu of five courses. All of them were interesting and delicious. The other two of us ordered off the menu also with great results. \nThe staff were very good at explaining the dishes in English and the owner was particularly helpful and fun. \nHighly recommended!\nRead more\nWritten February 25, 2019",
